ags-cd N/StarDustWars
stack >NIL: 65536
IF EXISTS WHDSaves:StarDustWars/Record
  copy WHDSaves:StarDustWars/Record Record QUIET
ENDIF
StarDustWars >NIL:
ags-cd N/StarDustWars
IF NOT EXISTS WHDSaves:StarDustWars
  makedir WHDSaves:StarDustWars
ENDIF
IF EXISTS Record
  copy Record WHDSaves:StarDustWars/Record QUIET
ENDIF
